The fastest honest options are:
- send Dana a prewritten letter and ask her to reply “approved” or paste it onto company letterhead;
- contact the employer now and say your reference is delayed and ask if a short extension is possible;
- offer another reference, if you have one.

I can draft any of those messages right now.
